WEBVTT

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:17.870
No one's home.

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:22.000
I'm pretending to be out.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.260
Just leave already.

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:33.260
Now then...

00:00:48.860 --> 00:00:50.150
Jeez!

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:51.910
This box is huge.

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:57.450
Oh, that's what it is.

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:01.330
Ooh.

00:01:01.330 --> 00:01:03.080
I'm back!

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:06.630
Sasami-san!

00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:08.720
I'm back home!

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:11.090
Would you like something to eat? Would you like to have a bath?

00:01:11.090 --> 00:01:13.090
Or would you rather spend time with m—

00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:14.050
The food.

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:14.720
Okay.

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:17.140
Today I've got some nice fresh mackerel.

00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:18.100
So?

00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:19.560
For dessert, I have jelly and...

00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:20.230
...pudding.

00:01:20.230 --> 00:01:22.600
Oh, you figured out I bought pudding too!

00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:24.270
That's my Sasami-san!

00:01:24.270 --> 00:01:26.190
There's nothing you don't know about me.

00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:29.070
That just goes to show how much you love me!

00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:32.200
Okay, go ahead and eat!

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:34.240
Feed it to me.

00:01:35.030 --> 00:01:36.660
Such a spoiled child.

00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:38.580
I'm starving here.

00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:40.120
I guess I'll have to.

00:01:40.120 --> 00:01:41.660
Open up!

00:01:55.220 --> 00:01:56.760
Onii-chan!

00:01:56.760 --> 00:01:58.180
What is it, Sasami-san?

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:00.180
Wash me.

00:02:00.180 --> 00:02:01.680
Such a spoiled child.

00:02:03.730 --> 00:02:05.190
Sasami-san...

00:02:05.810 --> 00:02:08.940
Don't you think it's about time you went to school?

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:10.280
I can't.

00:02:12.030 --> 00:02:13.910
You're still 16.

00:02:13.910 --> 00:02:15.320
Your whole life's ahead of you.

00:02:15.910 --> 00:02:18.240
Your future holds limitless possibilities.

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:21.160
There's <i>nothing</i> you can't do!

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:22.580
I can't.

00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:27.000
You didn't enter high school
just to stay at home, did you?

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:29.880
Why not try spending some time having fun at school?

00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:31.210
I said I can't!

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:35.720
My monotonous, boring, dull job as a teacher

00:02:35.720 --> 00:02:39.470
would become simply marvelous if you'd come to school!

00:02:39.930 --> 00:02:41.390
Don't expect anything from me.

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:42.770
Dry me.

00:02:42.770 --> 00:02:44.100
Of course, Sasami-san!

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:48.150
Dress me.

00:02:48.150 --> 00:02:49.440
Of course, Sasami-san!

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:53.320
Brush my teeth.

00:02:53.320 --> 00:02:54.570
Of course, Sasami-san!

00:02:58.700 --> 00:03:01.200
You're not going to bed yet, Sasami-san?

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:03.290
Staying up late is bad for your skin!

00:03:03.290 --> 00:03:04.540
Shut up.

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:06.620
Call me if you need anything.

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:08.460
All right, see you tomorrow!

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:11.960
Oh, it's time for late-night anime.

00:05:14.630 --> 00:05:15.800
Open up!

00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:19.510
Open up!

00:05:23.180 --> 00:05:25.640
I'll be heading to school now.

00:05:25.640 --> 00:05:28.730
If you feel at all inclined, you should come too.

00:05:28.730 --> 00:05:29.680
Onii-chan!

00:05:30.690 --> 00:05:32.060
Take this.

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:33.190
A packed lunch.

00:05:33.610 --> 00:05:35.110
For me, Sasami-san?

00:05:35.110 --> 00:05:37.190
Ah, what a wonderful day!

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:39.490
I should make today a Sasami anniversary!

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:41.990
Actually, wow!

00:05:41.990 --> 00:05:44.660
Today is February 14th!

00:05:45.410 --> 00:05:47.990
There's already Sasami-san's Staggering Anniversary and

00:05:53.500 --> 00:05:55.210
Oh, but it matters not.

00:05:55.210 --> 00:05:58.000
I'll add Sasami-san's "Packed a Lunch Anniversary" to the list

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.920
and have a huge celebration for all three!

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:00.670
Don't!

00:06:01.720 --> 00:06:03.840
It's a packed <i>lunch</i>.

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:05.720
You can't open it until lunchtime.

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:07.600
Oh, I see.

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:09.220
If you insist.

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:11.270
Okay, see you.

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:13.690
Yep! I'm off!

00:06:34.170 --> 00:06:35.830
Big Brother Surveillance System...

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:36.710
activate!

00:06:40.840 --> 00:06:43.340
And with that, I'm ready to roll.

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:50.720
It's almost like Sasami-san and I are newlyweds.

00:06:52.770 --> 00:06:54.770
Just go to school already.

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:04.780
Hm?

00:07:26.260 --> 00:07:29.760
Ribbit, ribbit!

00:07:31.100 --> 00:07:34.680
I'm a cute and cheerful little frog!

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:37.060
Tama-san!

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:39.360
Paparin, morning!

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:41.110
What are you doing?

00:07:41.110 --> 00:07:42.190
You'll catch a cold!

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:44.820
You see, the frogs...

00:07:44.820 --> 00:07:45.950
are all gone.

00:07:45.950 --> 00:07:49.450
So I'm being a frog instead!

00:07:49.450 --> 00:07:51.240
Ribbit, ribbit!

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:54.540
The frogs are hibernating right now.

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:56.210
Hibernating?

00:07:56.210 --> 00:08:00.210
What would you do if someone made a ruckus while you were sleeping?

00:08:01.840 --> 00:08:03.710
I'd kill them!

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:07.050
That's why you should let them sleep.

00:08:07.050 --> 00:08:09.720
You can play with them again when spring comes.

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:10.970
Okay!

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:12.970
I won't disturb their sleep!

00:08:17.270 --> 00:08:19.270
My stomach's growling.

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:22.070
Oh my. You're so helpless.

00:08:22.070 --> 00:08:24.190
You can have this, then.

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:26.820
I was going to have it for lunch,

00:08:26.820 --> 00:08:29.030
but I can always buy something at school.

00:09:08.030 --> 00:09:09.530
Onii-chan, you idiot.

00:09:10.450 --> 00:09:11.530
This time...

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:13.780
I won't let it slide!

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:27.340
This again.

00:09:35.350 --> 00:09:37.470
I can't...

00:09:41.560 --> 00:09:42.810
do this.

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:45.570
Onii-chan...

00:09:46.150 --> 00:09:47.280
I really...

00:09:48.610 --> 00:09:49.740
can't handle this.

00:10:08.840 --> 00:10:11.050
I knew it was no good.

00:10:14.180 --> 00:10:15.550
Onii-chan, you idiot.

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:18.560
I wanted it to be you who took my chocolate for the first time.

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:28.650
Tsurugi-sensei!

00:10:29.280 --> 00:10:32.990
I don't think erotic games are
appropriate for the faculty lounge.

00:10:42.460 --> 00:10:44.710
You owe me some barley tea.

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:47.040
Oh yeah, Tsukuyomi.

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:48.920
Did you get any chocolate?

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:51.670
No, not really.

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:53.130
I see.

00:10:53.130 --> 00:10:54.510
Then have this.

00:10:57.850 --> 00:11:00.600
D-Don't get the wrong idea.

00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:03.480
I'm just showing some pity
because you're way too pathetic.

00:11:03.940 --> 00:11:04.690
Pardon?

00:11:05.270 --> 00:11:07.310
I'm saying...

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:10.280
the one who popped your Valentine's Day cherry was...

00:11:10.280 --> 00:11:12.530
li'l ol' me!

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:24.000
I should've been his first.

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:29.380
How dare you do this to me,
you baby-faced bitch?!

00:11:39.890 --> 00:11:41.510
Enough of this.

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:44.520
I just can't win.

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:47.020
It's not worth the effort.

00:11:55.570 --> 00:11:58.030
That's incredibly creepy, Sensei.

00:11:58.570 --> 00:12:01.240
But I have nothing to do, Kagami-san!

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:03.790
I know, Kagami-san. Let's talk!

00:12:03.790 --> 00:12:05.710
Please choose which topic you'd prefer:

00:12:05.710 --> 00:12:08.250
"Sasami-san today," "Sasami-san yesterday,"

00:12:08.250 --> 00:12:11.710
"Sasami-san's charms,"
"The day I argued with Sasami-san,"

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:15.880
and of course the popular
"Sasami-san's embarrassing incident"!

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:20.260
Let's talk about the world's
most interesting topic, Sasami-san,

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:23.600
all we want until we're blue in the face!

00:12:23.600 --> 00:12:24.600
Huh?

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:27.980
I fell asleep.

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:32.980
Kagami-nee!

00:12:33.360 --> 00:12:34.780
What in the world is going on?

00:12:34.780 --> 00:12:35.940
Tama-san?

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:37.950
P-Paparin!

00:12:38.360 --> 00:12:42.740
Um, well, I sure do love you, Paparin,

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:45.080
but we should just be friends for now.

00:12:45.370 --> 00:12:47.620
What should I do?!

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:49.080
Y-You are choking me.

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:51.580
Oh, hey! All three of us sisters are here.

00:12:52.880 --> 00:12:54.710
N-Nee-san...

00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:56.010
Tsurugi-nee!

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:01.590
I don't know what you're talking about, but don't leave me out!

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:04.470
Listen, Tsurugi-nee. The thing is...

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:07.230
Paparin proposed to me!

00:13:07.850 --> 00:13:08.980
He what?

00:13:08.980 --> 00:13:12.610
She must've misunderstood his intentions.

00:13:12.610 --> 00:13:14.690
Valentine's Day?

00:13:14.690 --> 00:13:16.480
Well, put simply,

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:19.200
it's a day when you give chocolate to someone you're fond of.

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:20.700
I-It is?!

00:13:20.700 --> 00:13:22.620
Wow, no way! I can't believe it!

00:13:22.620 --> 00:13:25.330
Sasami-san understands
the world better than I do,

00:13:25.330 --> 00:13:27.000
so I'm sure she knows
about Valentine's Day.

00:13:27.000 --> 00:13:29.910
But even though I'm sure
Sasami-san loves me,

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:31.830
I haven't received any
chocolate from her!

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:32.920
Oh, of course.

00:13:32.920 --> 00:13:35.630
She must be planning to
give me some at the dinner table

00:13:35.630 --> 00:13:37.880
and say "I love you, Onii-chan!" while wearing a maid costume!

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:39.130
Like hell I will.

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:40.970
I have no time to waste here.

00:13:40.970 --> 00:13:43.640
I must quickly go and buy
a mountain of chocolate!

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:47.520
Still, that's a relief.

00:13:47.520 --> 00:13:50.440
He just didn't know about Valentine's Day.

00:13:51.230 --> 00:13:55.150
Oh well. I guess I'll buy him some more chocolate.

00:13:56.820 --> 00:13:59.320
Huh? I didn't know a new volume of this manga was out.

00:13:59.320 --> 00:14:02.070
Let's see. "What happens in this volume:

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:04.660
Not being honest with each other, the couple gets into a fight.

00:14:04.660 --> 00:14:10.160
But upon seeing Chiyoko's tears, Kakao
aims to become a first-class chocolatier"?

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:13.040
"Chocolate is everything. Chocolate is wonderful.

00:14:13.040 --> 00:14:15.000
He doesn't care about Chiyoko anymore.

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:16.540
A shocking new development"?

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:18.500
That's too shocking!

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:20.260
Wasn't this called <i>Love Between Angels</i>?

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:23.260
"Chocolate Between Angels."

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:25.720
Where did the chocolate come from?!

00:14:25.720 --> 00:14:26.510
Huh?

00:14:27.180 --> 00:14:30.810
Blu-rays printing for <i>Choco, Choco, and Chocolate</i>?!

00:14:30.810 --> 00:14:32.690
This one's only chocolate!

00:14:32.690 --> 00:14:34.480
Where did the love and election go?!

00:14:34.480 --> 00:14:38.480
"With the school festival right around the corner, the chocolate with the two is progressing rapidly"?!

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:41.530
"A battle action series featuring swords, magic, and chocolate."

00:14:41.950 --> 00:14:45.660
"This work features violent imagery and chocolate."

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:48.280
"A chocolatey and heartrending chocotale about

00:14:48.280 --> 00:14:50.450
choco'ing the chocolate taken away by the chocolate.

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:53.460
As the couple chocolate each other and go choco, they chocolatize."

00:14:54.960 --> 00:14:57.960
I can't even understand what these mean anymore.

00:14:57.960 --> 00:15:01.880
Oh yeah, I bet this is their Valentine's Day prank.

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:03.380
If I check out other sites...

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:09.310
"I was told I wouldn't get promoted unless I attend the chocolate meetings."

00:15:09.930 --> 00:15:11.850
"Regarding the Chocoslovakia problem."

00:15:12.480 --> 00:15:14.140
"Today's weather is generally chocolate,

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:17.440
intermittently white chocolate,
macadamia nut chocolate for some regions."

00:15:17.940 --> 00:15:19.570
What the hell?!

00:15:19.570 --> 00:15:20.530
Could it be...

00:15:30.410 --> 00:15:33.910
Wow, there's such a variety of chocolate these days.

00:15:34.500 --> 00:15:37.380
I should buy plenty and give it to Sasami-san so she'll go

00:15:37.380 --> 00:15:40.840
"I can't eat it all. I'll share some with you too!

00:15:40.840 --> 00:15:44.920
Don't get the wrong idea! I just don't
wanna get fat from eating too much!"

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:47.680
and act all coy like that!

00:15:47.680 --> 00:15:51.430
That way, Sasami-san will still
technically be giving me her chocolate!

00:15:53.060 --> 00:15:55.180
Oh no, a Transformation.

00:16:15.540 --> 00:16:17.830
This is just like in "Hansel and Gretel."

00:16:22.880 --> 00:16:25.550
Tama, you can eat all you want today!

00:16:26.170 --> 00:16:27.220
Really?!

00:16:28.220 --> 00:16:29.760
Now, bring it on!

00:16:29.760 --> 00:16:31.220
I'll teach you a lesson!

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:36.640
Time to dig in!

00:16:46.280 --> 00:16:47.530
Delicious!

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:54.830
Your attacks are too soft.

00:16:55.250 --> 00:16:56.330
As soft as chocolate.

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:03.960
Don't think you've got me licked.

00:17:03.960 --> 00:17:04.800
Licked like chocolate.

00:17:14.180 --> 00:17:15.850
I'm gonna chew you up.

00:17:15.850 --> 00:17:16.810
Like chewing chocolate.

00:17:23.360 --> 00:17:24.650
Moron!

00:17:26.110 --> 00:17:29.280
You need to make a real bang with your boob missiles!

00:17:29.280 --> 00:17:29.990
What?

00:17:29.990 --> 00:17:31.990
Don't give up just because they're small!

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:33.740
That's none of your business.

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:39.330
Choco-choco-chocolate!

00:18:00.480 --> 00:18:03.610
All right, on to Tsukuyomi's house!

00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:23.850
You're no more than a filthy demon!

00:19:46.120 --> 00:19:47.880
Kagami, mirror the world.

00:19:50.800 --> 00:19:54.970
Human world, return to the way you should be.

00:20:10.440 --> 00:20:12.190
I'm home!

00:20:19.490 --> 00:20:22.540
Sasami-san, I'm back!

00:20:22.540 --> 00:20:24.910
I hear today's Valentine's Day!

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:28.830
Girls are supposed to give chocolate to boys,

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:33.130
but my love transcends age, gender, and blood relations,

00:20:33.130 --> 00:20:36.220
so it's not a problem in the slightest!

00:20:37.180 --> 00:20:38.720
S-Sasami-san!

00:20:44.180 --> 00:20:45.060
I see.

00:20:45.060 --> 00:20:46.520
This must mean...

00:20:46.520 --> 00:20:50.100
"gobble me up," right?

00:20:50.100 --> 00:20:53.230
Then I'll just help myself
and lick, bite, and suck on you.

00:20:53.230 --> 00:20:56.360
I'm... I'm...

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:07.710
Cut that crap out!

00:21:07.710 --> 00:21:09.540
Die!

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:38.030
I couldn't help it.

00:21:38.360 --> 00:21:38.950
Okay?

00:21:48.290 --> 00:21:51.040
Get out.

00:21:51.040 --> 00:21:52.670
This is...

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:54.670
my home!

00:22:13.270 --> 00:22:15.230
I'm tired.

00:22:15.230 --> 00:22:17.940
That's the last time I ever try hard.

00:22:17.940 --> 00:22:22.280
But hold on! You aren't getting off so easily, Sasami-san.

00:22:22.280 --> 00:22:26.240
You're supposed to sing the
ending theme every episode.

00:22:26.240 --> 00:22:27.830
Here! Take the mic!

00:22:27.830 --> 00:22:30.410
Please sing in a loud voice!

00:22:30.410 --> 00:22:32.170
Bleugh!

00:22:32.170 --> 00:22:36.210
What asshole decided I have to do something like that?

00:22:36.210 --> 00:22:38.300
What a joke. I'll kill 'em.

00:22:38.300 --> 00:22:41.720
Sasami-san, you've said a little too much.

00:22:41.720 --> 00:22:45.300
Try to act a little more innocent, like a mewing kitty cat! Meow!

00:22:45.300 --> 00:22:47.560
Don't tell me what to do.

00:22:47.560 --> 00:22:52.310
Listen, the pre-recorded
song is already playing.

00:22:52.310 --> 00:22:54.350
Isn't that good enough?

00:22:54.350 --> 00:22:56.730
Do I need to actually sing it every time?

00:22:56.730 --> 00:22:57.440
I don't, do I?

00:22:57.440 --> 00:23:02.530
Oh no, having your beautiful singing
voice broadcast out across the nation

00:23:02.530 --> 00:23:05.660
is worth as much as this whole planet!

00:23:05.660 --> 00:23:09.450
Wait, Sasami-san, are you listening?

00:23:09.450 --> 00:23:12.290
Don't curl up in your blanket.

00:23:12.290 --> 00:23:14.540
You look like you're about to go to sleep.

00:23:14.540 --> 00:23:16.380
Be a little more involved!

00:23:16.380 --> 00:23:19.050
Effort never betrays you!

00:23:23.970 --> 00:23:28.760
Too bad. I couldn't get Sasami-san to get out of her bed at all.

00:23:28.760 --> 00:23:35.400
However, I'm sure I'll deliver Sasami-san's sweet singing voice to you all next time!

00:23:35.400 --> 00:23:37.560
Look forward to it!

00:23:43.950 --> 00:23:46.530
Time for Lazy Horoscopes.

00:23:46.530 --> 00:23:47.990
Weekly love horoscope.

00:23:47.990 --> 00:23:50.370
For normal Capricorns who have a date: Things go perfectly.

00:23:50.370 --> 00:23:53.710
Value time with your lover like the normal people you are.

00:23:53.710 --> 00:23:55.500
Light blue items bring good luck.

00:23:55.500 --> 00:23:57.420
Something good might happen.

00:23:57.420 --> 00:24:00.210
For you lonely Capricorns, there's nothing special.

00:24:00.210 --> 00:24:02.300
Good things will happen if you keep on living...

00:24:02.300 --> 00:24:03.630
probably.

00:24:03.630 --> 00:24:05.760
Don't worry about it! Wipe away your tears.

00:24:06.300 --> 00:24:07.680
Next time, episode two:

00:24:07.680 --> 00:24:09.100
"Home Security Guard."
